{
  "voice": "voice-00",
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "alignment": "one-clip-one-shot-one-caption",
  "slowdown_allowed": false,
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "1948年的东京，雪夜里，帝国银行亮着一扇灯。",
      "sha256": "86dbe2f614c56dc73db77986b35752c9b6b1b7b4f688b3ed8a07586f90ac1758"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "一个自称防疫官的男人，敲响了银行后门。",
      "sha256": "d70e1fe835a3257d9cd79b29cf7c5baeec0663b49d72cb1ac6ee5219061725c5"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "他递上名片，自称山口二郎，说附近爆发了痢疾。",
      "sha256": "ac814bf67cfea4e77307ee9603d137e4640bd5379e10a82591b0ef0b87f6ca44"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "他声称奉命送来预防药，要求职员立刻服用。",
      "sha256": "045d7598356497c86b6f9e6e8172a917986fd26a9ea05edb6f09536f44cd23fc"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "窗外，美军吉普车驶过，没人敢多问。",
      "sha256": "bad0a90537b9be1c9125e9a06b911c2c8863caba606290fe37576e8d9ed1e484"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "药箱里，装着两种透明药水。",
      "sha256": "2f6989433bc904a5ce4e4064f5532261bc8cf111c6a2d938c39ef1dbb38eedfd"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "他让十六个人排成一排，每人面前放一只小杯。",
      "sha256": "eb7809c10250bdfd5beddf899f9d555482c13f590fa684dfc2f9d44b03306f59"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "先喝第一种，他还亲自举杯示范。",
      "sha256": "474e06431ff23e5217c3925a68a4c2bddd4d0155c8ed790a878c35c1a101fb5d"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "一分钟，秒针一格一格地走过。",
      "sha256": "c534c38bd7806514b4c8729b10628529b92e29170c4f097f885f90e023e10d21"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "随后，第二种药水倒进杯中。",
      "sha256": "7c110fbe29cd79ccfd9d064f904218f2af7a950f1d6c25072bc7a7604e2d8087"
    }
  ]
}
